/-!
# Every certified direction window of the 239 automaton is refuted

`ref_<shape>`: each range tuple of the list `L<shape>` of `D239Table` is a packaged, kernel-checked
refutation (`Refuted2/3/4`: G2 RUP replay and G1 clause check).  Ten windows reuse the CNFs
refuted for the 241 bound (identical sha256); the 55 most expensive ones are refuted in their
symmetry-broken form (`RefutedL`, lex-leader clauses for the free coordinates).
-/
